<figure id="Ax1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span><span id="Ax1.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance under <math id="Ax1.T4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\epsilon=16/255}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>𝟏𝟔</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>𝟐𝟓𝟓</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\epsilon=16/255}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span> Injection with 4 repeats achieves the best scores: 66.6% untargeted ASR and 65.4% targeted ASR. The results for 4 and 8 repeats are similar, indicating that 4 repeats are sufficient for most cases.</figcaption>
<div id="Ax1.T4.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:249.8pt;height:155.6pt;vertical-align:-75.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-31.2pt,19.4pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
