<figure id="Ax1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span><span id="Ax1.T5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance under <math id="Ax1.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\epsilon=32/255}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>𝟑𝟐</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>𝟐𝟓𝟓</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\epsilon=32/255}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span> Injection with 4 repeats achieves the best scores: 77.0% untargeted ASR and 76.6% targeted ASR. The results for 4 and 8 repeats are similar.</figcaption>
